Description: interactive 3D medical image segmentation and navigation
 ITK-SNAP is an application for segmenting structures in 3D biomedical images.
 It provides semi-automatic active-contour (snake) segmentation, manual
 delineation across three orthogonal planes, and image navigation. It is widely
 used in neuroimaging and radiology for delineating anatomical structures.
 .
 Built on the Insight Toolkit (ITK), VTK and Qt 6.
